 • Island , a Dallas-based enterprise internet browser and control layer, raised $400m in Series F funding at a $6.4b valuation led by Evolution Equity Partners . axios.link/4xFrvBC 

 🚑 Precision Neuroscience , an NYC-based brain-computer interface startup, raised $250m at around a $1b valuation. The Ackman Oxman Institute and Pershing Square led, alongside an undisclosed life sciences fund. Other backers include Duquesne Family Office, B Capital Group, ARK Invest, Invus, Mubadala Capital, Mirae Asset Capital, Korea Investment Partners, Hitachi Ventures, and JSL Health Capital. axios.link/4hpVNm8 

 🚑 Rightway , an NYC-based pharmacy benefit management and care navigation startup, raised $155m in Series E funding. Francisco Partners led, joined by Thrive Capital and Khosla Ventures. axios.link/4xBw67X 

 🚑 Basecamp Research , a Cambridge, Mass.-based developer of AI models for therapeutic designs, raised $140m in Series C funding. S32 led, joined by Anthropic's Anthology Fund, Catalio, European Tech Collective, Firebrand River Capital, Inception Fund, King Philanthropies, NATO Innovation Fund, Nvidia, PostScriptum, Redalpine, The Rockefeller Foundation, Singular, Sovereign AI, and True Ventures. axios.link/3T25W0d 

 🚑 HighLife , a French developer of transcatheter treatments for heart diseases, raised $90m from Andera Partners, Sofinnova Partners, Supernova Invest, Mérieux Equity Partners, European Investment Bank, BNP Paribas Développement, Capricorn Partners, Critical Path Ventures, Pro Benefis Familiae, and SPRIM Global Investments. axios.link/46CQ8Ee 

 • Ultraviolette , an Indian developer of EV platforms, raised $85m. Yali Capital and TDK Ventures led, joined by Lip-Bu Tan. axios.link/3TMVKZ 

 🚑 BigHat Biosciences , a San Mateo, Calif.-based protein therapeutics developer, raised $75m in Series C funding. DFJ Growth and Premji Invest led, joined by Catalio, LG Technology Ventures, Sigmas Group, 8VC, Alexandria Venture Investments, Amgen, a16z, Discovery Ventures, Grids Capital, Intermountain Ventures, Lilly Ventures, Merck Global Health Innovation Fund, Quadrille Capital, and Section 32. axios.link/4hmrkoH 

 🚑 Kasvu Therapeutics , a Finnish developer of neuroplastogens for neuropsychiatric and neurodegenerative disorders, raised €30m in Series A funding. Hadean Ventures led, joined by Tesi, Innovestor Life Science Fund, Finnish Drug Discovery Center, Stephen Industries, Nordic Science Investments, and Helsinki University Funds. axios.link/4hlgQ9g 

 • Hifi , which helps businesses move money between bank accounts and stablecoins, raised $28m in Series A funding led by Left Lane Capital , per Axios Pro . axios.link/4hauFZl 

 • Pilgrim , a Redwood City, Calif.-based biological threat detection platform, raised $25m at a $150m valuation led by Buckley Ventures . axios.link/4AwLkhm 

 🚑 UltraSight , a Boston-based developer of cardiac workflows, raised $24m in Series B2 funding. Alive HealthTech Growth Fund led, joined by Deep Insight, Star51 Capital, Connecticut Innovations, eHealth Ventures, Mayo Clinic Ventures, NYU, and Iron Nation. axios.link/3TjYe1w 

 🚑 Basalt Health , a Nashville-based provider of post-acute care software, raised $20m in Series A funding, per Axios Pro . NEA led, joined by insiders Frist Cressey Ventures and 25m Health. axios.link/4AsVXl8 

 • Trebellar , an SF-based corporate real estate management platform, raised $18m in Series A funding, per Axios Pro . Blossom Capital led, joined by AltCapital, Haystack, 1Flourish, and Kfund. axios.link/3Vwhnhg 

 • Axya , a Montreal-based procurement platform for manufacturers, raised C$17m in Series A funding. McRock Capital led, joined by Yamaha Motor Ventures, BDC, and Real Ventures. axios.link/4d1kWlA 

 • Ipid , which verifies recipient account ownership for banks, raised $16m in Series A funding, per Axios Pro . Foundation Capital led, joined by Citi, HSBC, QED Investors, Monk's Hill Ventures, and Quona Capital. axios.link/4h8VtJv 

 • Soteris , an SF-based platform for the P&amp;C insurance industry, raised over $8m in seed funding. Spider Capital led, joined by Intact Private Capital, Amplify Partners, DCVC, the Webb Investment Network, Overlook Ventures, Clocktower Ventures, and Foundation Capital. axios.link/4rthjuF 

 • Fearn , an SF-based patent drafting and prosecution platform, raised $5.5m from Kindred Ventures, a16z Speedrun, Designer Fund, and Essence VC. axios.link/4rwTx15 

 
 
